      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Was just about to write a post about this but thank god theres one thats already had some traction, making sliders on avatars that changes body proportions atm means that the coliders will be really weird and the fact that the only way to fix them is to have the scripts be toggled on and off is really annoying, especially since toggling them causes to bones to jolt up and down when the script is disabled and enabled",
