  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-03-25T03:37:18.758Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Today I learned the hard way while trying to create something with physbones. Attempting to change slider values while in play mode is definitely not functional, be it manually or through animation.\nI am aware of the solution of turning the physbone component on and off, but doing this actually ruins the concept of what I'm trying to make. Plus it feels weird to have to just have two frames of it going from off to on.\nA more proper way of animating these would be amazing, and I'm sure others would appreciate it too.",
